   "subject": "3D vs. linear measurements",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I have 3D landmark data that describes avian bill shape. I would like to know how much of the variation in my 3D data is explained by linear measurements, such as length, width, and depth. Does anyone have any ideas as to how I could do this type of analysis in geomorph? <br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
